# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Promptly — Root .dockerignore
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Reduces build context for faster Docker builds.

.git
.github
.idea
.angular
.nx

node_modules

# Logs and temp files
*.log
*.txt
*.class

# Test artifacts
reports/
test-results/
playwright-output.txt
debug-test.txt
**/target/surefire-reports/
**/target/failsafe-reports/

# Documentation (not needed in images)
docs/
*.md
!README.md
LICENSE

# Seed data
seed-data/
